ual to $0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A{b}_{1} & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 \\\\ -4 & 2 \\\\ 6 & -3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]=0\\,✓ \\\\ A{b}_{2} & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 \\\\ -4 & 2 \\\\ 6 & -3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 10 \\\\ -15\\end{aligned}]\\ne 0\\,\\times  \\\\ A{b}_{3} & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 \\\\ -4 & 2 \\\\ 6 & -3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]=0\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, only ${b}_{1}$ and ${b}_{3}$ lie in $\\text{Null}(A).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064430/state.json" "file_sha256" "d05b52825909934a0512cdab552abffb2799d70e561f1fb95b21200ec238a597"} {"question" "q-111079" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064430/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "957f63cde2a2b80b6a3155a15a71a6f9a44b9558ecc0cc90896f8184b7336d1a"} {"question" "q-111079" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064430/state.json" "file_sha256" "d05b52825909934a0512cdab552abffb2799d70e561f1fb95b21200ec238a597"} {"question" "q-111079" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["text" "${b}_{1}$ and ${b}_{2}$ only"] ["text" "${b}_{1}$ and ${b}_{3}$ only"] ["text" "${b}_{1}$ only"] ["text" "${b}_{2}$ and ${b}_{3}$ only"] ["text" "${b}_{2}$ only"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14064430/state.json" "file_sha256" "d05b52825909934a0512